meta {
  name: Devices list
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/devices
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  Mirrors live-location-proof.ts:155 - the proof lists devices to find (or
  create, which this collection deliberately does not) its test device.
  Position ingest happens over the OsmAnd protocol on port 5055, not this
  REST surface; a curl GET with lat/lon params there is how positions arrive.
}
